stuff to figure out  when they get there i suppose  and we'll see how that goes next week  this was pretty much what i expected so  i was pretty happy with the episode  it finishes off amos's journey to earth  avasarala is back in charge  and the razorback and ross ante are both  heading towards naomi  so that's pretty much everything that  had to happen the drummer stuff  is pretty intense and it's hard to see  how she can get out of that situation  without killing karol  it seemed pretty unlikely considering  there's no doubt that marco will space  surge in retaliation but i'm having  trouble thinking of a different outcome  she could leave the family but then  she'll probably be hunted down herself  so i don't know let me know if you see a  future where drummer learns to play nice  with the free navy because they aren't  making it easy  the avasarala scenes were interesting  and her saying goodbye to arjun had some  weight to it  i really enjoyed seeing amos torn  between his old ways of thinking and the  new  and how having eric and clarissa there  served to pull him in different  directions where there were no easy  decisions  that seems like a pretty good place to  leave things i'll talk about where  things might be going in my preview  video which will come out in a few days  let me know in the comments what you're  thinking what you thought of this  episode what you think's gonna happen in  the finale  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

